 rigid and oppressive vision. As Pivolo’s tyranny spreads, society begins to question the value of art itself, forgetting its power to inspire, heal, and bring people together.<strong> It falls upon four heroes: each wielding their own unique creative abilities to challenge this bleak new reality!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/85aee2826e7066e11c607ef5c9c28380.poster.avif?t=1781178034\" width=1170 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/85aee2826e7066e11c607ef5c9c28380.webm?t=1781178034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/85aee2826e7066e11c607ef5c9c28380.mp4?t=1781178034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world is losing its spark. Inspiration is fading. The forces of uniformity and oppression are closing in. <strong>But art will not go quietly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/327d0567a73748fa4d5d8b76a3ca0071.poster.avif?t=1781178034\" width=1170 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/327d0567a73748fa4d5d8b76a3ca0071.webm?t=1781178034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse